        <mxCell id="steps" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Architecture Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Internet traffic enters via IGW&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;② IGW routes to public subnets&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;③ NAT Gateways in each AZ&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;④ Private instances route outbound via NAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑤ Multi-AZ for high availability" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#E0E0E0;fontSize=12;spacing=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
